# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0037): a scratch probe, waiting for the owner's rm. It exported package-global
# names (`task add`, `form box`, `form colour`) into every program that loads the stdlib.


load @term/base/list
  find push

form box
  link tag, like text
  link items
    like list
      like text

task add
  take b, like box
  take item, like text
  call push
    read b/items
    read item
